00:15:29,850 --> 00:15:32,930
which is the reason why you need to know about containment.
这就是为什么你需要了解防护。

354
00:15:32,930 --> 00:15:33,810
If there were no laws,
如果没有法律，

355
00:15:33,810 --> 00:15:35,610
there was no need for containment.
就不需要防护了。

356
00:15:37,130 --> 00:15:41,010
Non-compliance can lead to punitive action.
不遵守法规可能会导致惩罚性措施。

357
00:15:41,010 --> 00:15:44,770
There's legal consequences for non-compliance.
不遵守法规会带来法律后果。

358
00:15:44,770 --> 00:15:49,210
So in order to manage this system,
所以，为了管理这个体系，

359
00:15:49,210 --> 00:15:51,290
we have to be aware of the process
我们必须了解

360
00:15:51,290 --> 00:15:53,490
of biological risk assessment.
生物风险评估的流程。

361
00:15:53,490 --> 00:15:55,770
Okay, so in biological risk assessment,
好，在生物风险评估中，

362
00:15:55,770 --> 00:15:57,810
there are three basic procedures.
有三个基本程序。

363
00:15:57,810 --> 00:16:00,370
You do a risk, first you do a risk assessment.
你要做风险，首先你要做风险评估。

364
00:16:01,250 --> 00:16:03,450
The second thing you do is you mitigate the risk
第二件事是通过风险缓解

365
00:16:03,450 --> 00:16:05,170
by doing a risk mitigation.
来降低风险。

366
00:16:05,170 --> 00:16:07,010
And the third thing which you perform
第三件事是

367
00:16:07,010 --> 00:16:09,010
is a performance assessment.
进行绩效评估。

368
00:16:09,010 --> 00:16:10,610
So you got risk assessment,
所以有风险评估、

369
00:16:10,610 --> 00:16:13,530
risk mitigation, and performance assessment.
风险缓解和绩效评估。

370
00:16:13,530 --> 00:16:14,370
So as I told you,
正如我跟大家说过的，

371
00:16:14,370 --> 00:16:18,290
risk is a function of likelihood and consequence.
风险是可能性和后果的函数。

372
00:16:18,290 --> 00:16:21,530
So for every action or experiment that you perform,
所以对于你进行的每一项操作或实验，

373
00:16:21,530 --> 00:16:25,690
you need to assess the level of risk,
你都需要评估风险水平，

374
00:16:25,690 --> 00:16:27,330
likelihood and consequence.
也就是可能性和后果。

375
00:16:27,330 --> 00:16:29,690
Once you assess the level of risk,
评估了风险水平之后，

376
00:16:29,690 --> 00:16:31,730
you need to apply controls.
你需要实施控制措施。

377
00:16:31,730 --> 00:16:35,410
So those controls are elimination, substitution.
这些控制措施包括消除、替代，

378
00:16:35,410 --> 00:16:37,210
You have your engineering controls,
还有工程控制、

379
00:16:37,210 --> 00:16:38,770
administrative control,
管理控制

380
00:16:38,770 --> 00:16:41,850
and personal protective equipment.
和个人防护装备。

381
00:16:42,930 --> 00:16:44,450
So you apply these controls.
你实施这些控制措施。

382
00:16:44,450 --> 00:16:46,530
And then when you apply the control,
实施控制措施之后，

383
00:16:46,530 --> 00:16:47,770
you assess the risk again.
你要再次评估风险。

384
00:16:47,770 --> 00:16:51,050
And if it's acceptable, you decide to work with it.
如果风险可以接受，你就决定开展工作。

385
00:16:51,050 --> 00:16:55,530
If it's not acceptable, you apply more controls, okay.
如果不可接受，就实施更多的控制措施，好。

386
00:16:55,530 --> 00:16:58,330
So the degree of controls is basically limited
所以，控制措施的程度基本上受到

387
00:16:58,330 --> 00:17:00,490
by your financial commitment.
资金投入的限制。

388
00:17:00,490 --> 00:17:02,770
So if you need to carry out high risk experiments,
所以，如果你需要开展高风险实验，

389
00:17:02,770 --> 00:17:05,370
you have to ensure that you have a sufficient
就必须确保为风险缓解

390
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:10,250
financial commitment towards that risk mitigation.
投入足够的资金。

391
00:17:11,450 --> 00:17:14,250
And the last thing which you need to take into account
最后，就植物而言，

392
00:17:14,250 --> 00:17:16,650
with regard to plant is the design consideration
你需要考虑的是设施的

393
00:17:16,650 --> 00:17:18,370
for the facility.
设计因素。

394
00:17:18,370 --> 00:17:22,690
So that's the summary of this module.
以上就是本模块的总结。
